# 统一换行：仓库内文本一律 LF，避免 Windows 检出后整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保持 CRLF，cmd.exe 对 LF 结尾的 bat 兼容性差
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制：禁止换行转换与 diff
*.bin binary
*.ckpt binary
*.apk binary
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary

# 生成物 / 大文件不做 diff 展示
tools/golden/*.json -diff
